  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stop Paying the Polluter</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Big Oil has us over a barrel. Investor state dispute settlements, backed by international treaties and free trade mechanisms mean billions of dollars are being handed to fossil fuel investors in cases where positive climate action by governments is damaging fossil fuel asset values. Not only is this paying polluters, but the fear of being sued prevents governments from acting. This research project exposes the scale of the payments, the extent of the fear, and pushes for renegotiation.</narrative>
  </description>
